            "review_title": "Review at Boon Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Ray Ray Ray\nDubai, United Arab Emirates936 contributions\n0\nThe overall seating is ok I suppose. Comfortable. Open air space.\nJun 2023 • Friends\nSearching high and low. Where’s this Boon’s kitchen. Finally. It’s above the filling station. (-1 point for no adequate signage and forcing me to weave my way around to find a staff member who could help me find the place)\n\nThey advertise a Burger King or maybe King Burger with a drink for 135k but don’t bother. This ain’t flame grilled. It’s pan cooked and the end result was just mediocre if not gut rot. (-1 point)\n\nThe overall seating is ok I suppose. Comfortable. Open air space. Fans are provided when it’s hot but Onlyfans are not. Service is provided. Not much to worry about if Huda beer is your thing.\n\nWould I come back? Not for me. It’s too much of a mismatch for my own dining tastes: quality, value, care.\n\nThere are people out there who just want to fill their stomachs for a cheap price. This might be the place for them. 3/5 stars.\nRead more\nWritten July 8, 2023",
